# Documentation System

- Primary AI-facing documentation: `docs/ai/`.
- Files: `ARCHITECTURE.md`, `PROJECT_RULES.md`, `PAGE_DOCS.md`, `DECISIONS.md`, `CHANGELOG_AI.md`, `AGENT_IMPROVEMENTS.md`.
- Before changes, consult relevant docs if they exist.
- When behavior changes, update the relevant documentation. Keep docs factual and concise.
- Never invent content for `docs/ai/`. Only populate from repository evidence, existing docs, or explicit user instructions. Use placeholders or TODO where facts are unknown.
